invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_encrypted_exts_test
reason: the EncryptedExtensions handler hands the parser a temporary
  instead of ch_tls.server_cert_type, so the type the server selected
  is dropped and the session reports X.509 after a RawPublicKey
  selection. hsa_server_auth then reads the server's one raw key as a
  certificate chain. bin/webpki_encrypted_exts_test's raw-key row reads
  the session's type, and it objects.

--- old
        &t->alpn_selected, t->cfg.hostname_len > 0, webpki_cert_types_offered(&t->cfg),
        &t->server_cert_type,
--- new
        &t->alpn_selected, t->cfg.hostname_len > 0, webpki_cert_types_offered(&t->cfg),
        &(uint8_t){CH_CERT_TYPE_X509},
